 after an illness", "x": 0.12164580466850651}, {"x": 0.11985688744825687, "text": "b", "y": 0.45523255828528214, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "w": 0.01431127018398709}, {"y": 0.456497093274381, "x": 0.1341681582927841, "h": 0.010303448257893895, "text": "to get completely better after an illness", "w": 0.27906975640190973}, {"text": "to fight to get better when you are ill or injured", "y": 0.4691424421216827, "w": 0.33094811333550345, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "x": 0.1341681560633158}, {"y": 0.4828971118492996, "h": 0.011536027412552254, "text": "d to become 100% fit again after an illness", "w": 0.3005366685655382, "x": 0.12164580110184621}, {"text": "e to get better after an illness or injury", "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.2683363003200955, "x": 0.12164580663780548, "y": 0.49696220972161004}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.39713772243923606, "x": 0.09838999884299363, "y": 0.5197238374705199, "text": "4 Complete the sentences with one word in each gap."}, {"y": 0.5398240071139478, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "x": 0.14132378839419243, "w": 0.35062611897786455, "text": "It takes a long time to recover from some diseases."}, {"text": "1 My dad was badly injured at work but doctors are", "w": 0.3595706515842014, "x": 0.11985689216407107, "h": 0.012727520483065188, "y": 0.5563131770882027}, {"h": 0.014391274193994493, "y": 0.571329072234432, "text": "sure he will —", "x": 0.14304686051134696, "w": 0.1003105756971571}, {"y": 0.5706904584659267, "x": 0.284355724030426, "w": 0.10231497870551215, "h": 0.010121248220278385, "text": "a full recovery."}, {"w": 0.01073345184326173, "y": 0.5842151166094511, "text": "2", "x": 0.11985688773370605, "h": 0.008851743820341854}, {"y": 0.5841877256354301, "x": 0.13059034023764587, "w": 0.2504472181532118, "text": "I felt terrible after my illness but I'm", "h": 0.00902978339350174}, {"w": 0.04293380737304686, "x": 0.44722719286982726, "text": "to full", "y": 0.5841877255243378, "h": 0.011408204330864402}, {"w": 0.08238630506727432, "h": 0.010515746889561986, "x": 0.1412755402494895, "text": "fitness now.", "y": 0.5966607310441533}, {"text": "3 It took me almost a year to", "x": 0.1198568926230854, "y": 0.6120348838927994, "h": 0.01141276953452761, "w": 0.20572450425889754}, {"text": "_ my strength", "y": 0.6132400722711738, "w": 0.08944543626573354, "h": 0.010207581227436872, "x": 0.38461538560467473}, {"w": 0.10375670539008247, "y": 0.6258032492819873, "h": 0.01025779697008507, "text": "after my illness", "x": 0.1413237950330446}, {"w": 0.3631484646267361, "h": 0.012732085312316574, "text": "Mr Chambers died last month at the age of 87 after", "y": 0.6385901165402874, "x": 0.13237925000625056}, {"x": 0.14126907353722676, "w": 0.08776596917046442, "text": "a long battle", "y": 0.6535222220386198, "h": 0.010600904243517457}, {"h": 0.010207581227436872, "text": "ill health.", "x": 0.2933810385047847, "y": 0.6536777977207406, "w": 0.06440071529812286}, {"h": 0.011572548293034566, "x": 0.1055456154488655, "text": "REMEMBER THIS", "w": 0.13416815863715276, "y": 0.684113372380808}, {"y": 0.7081395351346234, "w": 0.34883721245659727, "x": 0.10912342876722919, "h": 0.01149494132840683, "text": "In English, there are many time expressions used to"}, {"h": 0.011440160007683312, "y": 0.7219900722995536, "x": 0.10912343416556117, "text": "describe past events.", "w": 0.14490161471896704}, {"y": 0.740349259030492, "h": 0.013560258111368524, "x": 0.10900019735823646, "text": "At the same time - used to talk about to two past", "w": 0.34372378879123267}, {"y": 0.7561462094598234, "h": 0.011426464771105508, "x": 0.10912344196520646, "w": 0.3703040907118056, "text": "events that took place simultaneously: In 2013, I broke"}, {"text": "my leg and had to go to hospital. At the same time", "x": 0.10912342766739777, "w": 0.34704830593532987, "h": 0.011563417885708053, "y": 0.7701017444685623}, {"text": "(= when / broke my leg), Helen fell off her horse and", "x": 0.10733453330072293, "w": 0.35599283854166663, "h": 0.012659044300175787, "y": 0.7827470932212467}, {"w": 0.14490159776475695, "h": 0.011453855244261213, "x": 0.1091234432464229, "y": 0.7965839351972418, "text": "also went to hospital."}, {"h": 0.01324938095863975, "x": 0.10904033318468274, "y": 0.8168614734806114, "text": "By this time - used when one past event took place", "w": 0.3543559095594618}, {"text": "before the other: We left hospital in July. By this time,", "y": 0.8306935044839066, "h": 0.013182855461478729, "w": 0.36689748128255206, "x": 0.10725827101487767}, {"y": 0.8447093024184171, "x": 0.10554562654664133, "text": "(= at some point before July) we were in love.", "w": 0.31305901421440974, "h": 0.011549723023541975}, {"h": 0.008851743820341854, "w": 0.010733451843261688, "text": "5", "x": 0.5402504476919648, "y": 0.2908430235493131}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "Read REMEMBER THIS. Complete the sentences with", "x": 0.5617173579398188, "y": 0.29084302348090196, "w": 0.3828264702690972}, {"text": "the correct time expression.", "y": 0.30465703982277786, "h": 0.011476680888165624, "x": 0.5617173557376249, "w": 0.20393559773763015}, {"w": 0.3416815524631077, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "x": 0.5831842707630794, "text": "I left school in 2014. At the same time my brother", "y": 0.3249854651683054}, {"x": 0.5831842574368507, "y": 0.33881317671433386, "text": "left university and got a job.", "w": 0.19320214165581595, "h": 0.011462985651587822}, {"text": "1", "w": 0.008944543202718092, "x": 0.5617173526383547, "y": 0.3528052325934628, "h": 0.008851743820341951}, {"x": 0.5831842647734533, "text": "On July 10t, I went back to the hospital.", "y": 0.35280523279406645, "w": 0.2772808498806424, "h": 0.012704694839160775}, {"y": 0.3678655232786965, "w": 0.17889087253146707, "h": 0.01023040687134109, "x": 0.6958855088743977, "text": "_ my leg was much better."}, {"h": 0.008851743820341854, "x": 0.5617173526532623, "y": 0.3806250002355413, "text": "2", "w": 0.008944543202718092}, {"y": 0.38062500025617